  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Brand introduction: </strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We are a small business based in London. Our goal is to increase the wellbeing of people who are 35+ and can&rsquo;t rely on being young anymore for their health. We do this whilst keeping in mind the planet, and people who are vegan and/or gluten free.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>Product description:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">High quality supplements such as:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Multi Vitamins</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Fish Oils</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Turmeric</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Amino Acids</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Vitamin B/C/D</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Supplements are Made in the UK.\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Supplements that are made abroad and shipped to the UK lose quality in transport.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">All our suplements have undergone rigorous testing and analysis to ensure that they're of the utmost quality and standard, adhering to all the latest industry requirements.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Unlike big retailers, our supplements contain 100% active ingredients and NO fillers.\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">* Fillers reduce the quality of the product and are used to bulk out supplements to squeeze extra profit from the customer.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">100% recyclable pouches as we're firmly committed to protecting the environment.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All our supplements are vegan and gluten free (except for fish oil supplements).</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>Payment terms:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We pay 20% commission on all orders processed via your affiliate link. Commision will be paid out on a monthly basis.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>Other information:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">If you become an affiliate, you will be able to choose 4 products from our webiste you think best aligns with your audience and brand. We will ship these products to you free of charge so you can start advertising with the product itself.</p>",
